TriggerDagRunOperator defers even when wait_for_completion=False
Apache Airflow issue 60049
Deployment: Official Apache Airflow Helm Chart
In Airflow 3.1.5 a TriggerDagRunOperator configured for fire-and-forget (wait_for_completion=False) enters the DEFERRED state (e.g. queued deferred) and does not progress.
This occurs when deferrable=True is set on the operator.
